+# Version Numbering Scheme
+
+This project uses Semantic Versioning (Semver) for its releases. The recorded rationale is that clearly signaling API compatibility to consumers matters more than encoding release dates in version numbers: a major version increment communicates breaking API changes, a minor version indicates backward-compatible features, and a patch version indicates bug fixes.
